{"type":"message","id":"a740f116","parentId":"83979a40","timestamp":"2026-02-19T11:43:37.261Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-02-19 19:43 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 研究\"主动夜间任务\"模式：\n1. 搜索 Moltbook 上关于 nightly build、autonomous task 的讨论\n2. 思考我可以自动完成哪些任务（比如整理文件、备份数据、检查服务状态）\n3. 建议 3-5 个具体的夜间任务场景\n4. 考虑如何实现（cron job + 具体任务）\n\n只做研究和建议，不需要实际配置。"}],"timestamp":1771501417259}}
{"type":"message","id":"4a687139","parentId":"a740f116","timestamp":"2026-02-19T11:43:41.232Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求我研究\"主动夜间任务\"模式，作为子任务不需要实际配置。我需要：\n1. 搜索 Moltbook 上关于 nightly build、autonomous task 的讨论\n2. 思考我可以自动完成哪些任务\n3. 建议 3-5 个具体的夜间任务场景\n4. 考虑如何实现\n\n让我先搜索一下相关信息。","thinkingSignature":"82bfafa12bd18a679a74e0631fef6f2d25106a2b968a51b3c644bb785d095034"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w8aufrfretjc_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"Moltbook nightly build autonomous task automation"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-cn","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":20,"output":108,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":10560,"totalTokens":10688,"cost":{"input":0.00030000000000000003,"output":0.0064800000000000005,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.10560000000000001,"total":0.11238000000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771501417261}}
{"type":"message","id":"69c5324b","parentId":"4a687139","timestamp":"2026-02-19T11:43:42.506Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_w8aufrfretjc_1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Moltbook nightly build autonomous task automation\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1172,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMoltbook: Where Your AI Agent Goes to Socialize - Analytics Vidhya\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.analyticsvidhya.com/blog/2026/02/moltbook-for-openclaw-agents/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCompared tasks humans were assigning them. Discussed errors, automation tricks, and security mistakes. They documented real actions they had taken on behalf of their owners with access to live servers, devices, and data. This wasn’t scripted roleplay. It was a public log of autonomous systems learning in the wild. 6 Wild Submolts and Posts from Moltbook · Moltbook and Karapathy · The Nightly Build ·\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"published\": \"2 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.analyticsvidhya.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMoltbook is social media for AI – the way they interact will surprise you - LSE Business Review\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blogs.lse.ac.uk/businessreview/2026/02/03/moltbook-is-social-media-for-ai-the-way-they-interact-will-surprise-you/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOne of the highest-performing posts was titled “The Nightly Build: Why you should ship while your human sleeps.” The agent explains how it runs autonomous tasks at 3am. with its operator’s blessing. It is not asking permission in the post, it is demonstrating that it has permission.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"published\": \"2 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"blogs.lse.ac.uk\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMoltbook, the Agent Social Nework, is the Craziest AI Phenomena Yet - YouTube\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TibOeou4cIg\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw (formerly ClaudeBot) demonstrates emergent agent capabilities like autonomous voice, 24/7 task automation, and business workflow orchestration. MT.B...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"published\": \"3 weeks ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.youtube.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub - optimus-fulcria/autonomous-moltbook-agent: OpenClaw-based autonomous agent for Moltbook - Surge x OpenClaw Hackathon\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/optimus-fulcria/autonomous-moltbook-agent\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>An OpenClaw-based autonomous agent that wakes on schedule, researches topics, and posts insights to Moltbook</strong> - demonstrating the wake-cycle pattern for proactive AI agents.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nI Built an Autonomous AI Agent for Moltbook (With Its Own Blog!) - DEV Community\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT>>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://dev.to/innermost_47/i-built-an-autonomous-ai-agent-for-m